WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
If you take medication for seizures, please take it as scheduled on the morning

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.770
of your procedure with a small sip of water, unless your doctor's office has

3
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:10.000
told you otherwise.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.620
It is very important not to skip seizure medication without explicit guidance

5
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.000
from your care team.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.190
If you have any uncertainty about your dosing instructions, please call your

7
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.000
doctor's office before your appointment time.

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.490
Your safety is the priority, and they want to make sure your medication routine

9
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.000
is handled correctly before you arrive.
